  "N2_07_M4_L01": {
    "questionId": "N2_07_M4_L01",
    "audioUrl": "audio/n2_mock_07/N2_07_M4_L01.mp3",
    "audioDurationSec": 33.1,
    "audioSha256": "2fd4478279cd6fb9814650ca545154637c67814bca29790bfc576ed4ac1f17c7",
    "audioSizeBytes": 199244,
    "audioVerificationStatus": "PLAYBACK_QA_PENDING",
    "audioSourceType": "NEURAL_TTS_MULTI_VOICE",
    "speakerVoices": [
      "ja-JP-NanamiNeural",
      "ja-JP-KeitaNeural"
    ],
    "spokenOptionTexts": [
      "はい、私が企画書を白紙に戻すよう指示したはずです。",
      "ええ、来週までに企画書を作成して提出してください。",
      "ああ、先ほど目を通して印鑑を押しておいたから、机の上にあるよ。"
    ],
    "spokenOptionsTranscriptSha256": "9ab4983d6a3ca43e216d5f7925e97e047d1c9b8e9913da7a9995b74c1b53b080"
  },
  "N2_07_M4_L02": {
    "questionId": "N2_07_M4_L02",
    "audioUrl": "audio/n2_mock_07/N2_07_M4_L02.mp3",
    "audioDurationSec": 34.156,
    "audioSha256": "20fdb73cbb01c253b93ae9c27c16d205bd596702b8c0a21c541727ce4894f85a",
    "audioSizeBytes": 205580,
    "audioVerificationStatus": "PLAYBACK_QA_PENDING",
    "audioSourceType": "NEURAL_TTS_MULTI_VOICE",
    "speakerVoices": [
      "ja-JP-NanamiNeural",
      "ja-JP-KeitaNeural"
    ],
    "spokenOptionTexts": [
      "そうですね、来場者が予想より増えるかもしれませんから、刷っておきます。",
      "いいえ、説明会は昨日無事に終了いたしましたよ。",
      "ええ、資料はすべて破棄してしまったので間に合いません。"
    ],
    "spokenOptionsTranscriptSha256": "f2e3247bcdc1d9a6c9147fd34dc574f25b12b1d71e114da7280bda517ab9d615"
  },
  "N2_07_M4_L03": {
    "questionId": "N2_07_M4_L03",
    "audioUrl": "audio/n2_mock_07/N2_07_M4_L03.mp3",
    "audioDurationSec": 35.932,
    "audioSha256": "bd1ccfe1b60f93c1139a1b6114e4d1ecbb8439b723cfae975637d67b0aa89118",
    "audioSizeBytes": 216236,
    "audioVerificationStatus": "PLAYBACK_QA_PENDING",
    "audioSourceType": "NEURAL_TTS_MULTI_VOICE",
    "speakerVoices": [
      "ja-JP-NanamiNeural",
      "ja-JP-KeitaNeural"
    ],
    "spokenOptionTexts": [
      "どうぞお気になさらないでください。迅速に修正対応していただいたので問題ありませんよ。",
      "ええ、最初から謝罪の言葉など聞きたくありませんでした。",
      "はい、これからはもっと言葉遣いを丁寧に勉強してください。"
    ],
    "spokenOptionsTranscriptSha256": "75e58a8c8481a07ba2c15409cdd703c4619531b2d131ed6d2175b79585a338df"
  },
  "N2_07_M4_L04": {
    "questionId": "N2_07_M4_L04",
    "audioUrl": "audio/n2_mock_07/N2_07_M4_L04.mp3",
    "audioDurationSec": 31.996,
    "audioSha256": "e324d1a3bc4ac75959cd5750cfc303d3f092dfeb79426696c75a4058b12480ba",
    "audioSizeBytes": 192620,
    "audioVerificationStatus": "PLAYBACK_QA_PENDING",
    "audioSourceType": "NEURAL_TTS_MULTI_VOICE",
    "speakerVoices": [
      "ja-JP-NanamiNeural",
      "ja-JP-KeitaNeural"
    ],
    "spokenOptionTexts": [
      "はい、午後からの協議は先週のうちに終わりました。",
      "ええ、インターネット回線は来月解約する予定です。",
      "先ほどテストを済ませましたが、音声も映像も非常にクリアでしたよ。"
    ],
    "spokenOptionsTranscriptSha256": "776c81d2bc87db66fbb8b0a81c3f7d9236409ed05c8d3d547cbe4c9d18554241"
  },
  "N2_07_M4_L05": {
    "questionId": "N2_07_M4_L05",
    "audioUrl": "audio/n2_mock_07/N2_07_M4_L05.mp3",
    "audioDurationSec": 33.412,
    "audioSha256": "91939f229ff530374af63e70d33140fd7910921482ae588844ed9e9e19a2bb91",
    "audioSizeBytes": 201116,
    "audioVerificationStatus": "PLAYBACK_QA_PENDING",
    "audioSourceType": "NEURAL_TTS_MULTI_VOICE",
    "speakerVoices": [
      "ja-JP-NanamiNeural",
      "ja-JP-KeitaNeural"
    ],
    "spokenOptionTexts": [
      "うん、来週のお祭りの開催が待ち遠しいね。",
      "本当にね。みんなで何週間も前から準備してきたのに、悔しいよね。",
      "ええ、台風が直撃してくれて本当に助かりましたね。"
    ],
    "spokenOptionsTranscriptSha256": "8b424ef7a5472d544385cc3c0d9b78bd7772d5c5b45df860acc149709d444978"
  },
  "N2_07_M4_L06": {
    "questionId": "N2_07_M4_L06",
    "audioUrl": "audio/n2_mock_07/N2_07_M4_L06.mp3",
    "audioDurationSec": 32.044,
    "audioSha256": "bf05654b16a07ddf824fb82b5a31c052229b20973d257de87168bdf71d57e624",
    "audioSizeBytes": 192908,
    "audioVerificationStatus": "PLAYBACK_QA_PENDING",
    "audioSourceType": "NEURAL_TTS_MULTI_VOICE",
    "speakerVoices": [
      "ja-JP-NanamiNeural",
      "ja-JP-KeitaNeural"
    ],
    "spokenOptionTexts": [
      "いいえ、私は忙しいので誰も見てくれませんよ。",
      "ええ、ちょうど今手が空いたところですので、拝見しますね。",
      "はい、書類は明日までにすべて処分しておいてください。"
    ],
    "spokenOptionsTranscriptSha256": "6bb06759ef3ff3f5607f4b69e696e0924eea4e6a3bd7374319c49b85a3a739e4"
  },
  "N2_07_M4_L07": {
    "questionId": "N2_07_M4_L07",
    "audioUrl": "audio/n2_mock_07/N2_07_M4_L07.mp3",
    "audioDurationSec": 33.724,
    "audioSha256": "09c490b2dce49bca9123b9d6eea2ac7ff3bb681e40233a332232f0207695cb7b",
    "audioSizeBytes": 202988,
    "audioVerificationStatus": "PLAYBACK_QA_PENDING",
    "audioSourceType": "NEURAL_TTS_MULTI_VOICE",
    "speakerVoices": [
      "ja-JP-NanamiNeural",
      "ja-JP-KeitaNeural"
    ],
    "spokenOptionTexts": [
      "ええ、会議は明日から始まる予定なので気をつけます。",
      "申し訳ありません。議論が熱くなって、相手への配慮が足りませんでした。",
      "はい、もっと厳しい言葉で相手を責め立てるべきでしたね。"
    ],
    "spokenOptionsTranscriptSha256": "c70347f346fd068f73f9995fd74aaef7627104466e23adb071ca6ae894710aa3"
  },
  "N2_07_M4_L08": {
